The pickaxe, sword, shovel and axe textures of SCG Tools are adaptations of textures from
Tinkers' Construct by SlimeKnights (https://github.com/SlimeKnights/TinkersConstruct).
The tool shapes are based on the original textures; colors and several details were redrawn for SCG Tools.

